# Bluesky (outside the repo: EXACT_APP_DIR, a local run, not the lane's; its
# first screen is the live network). Scrolling the feed hides the header on a
# `translate` spring and scrolling back shows it (LLP 1071 §7).
wheel feed-discover 1200
clock +100
wheel feed-discover 900
wheel feed-discover -1600
clock +150
wheel feed-discover -3000
